  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Prosperity - Linking and Learning Germany</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of the global coordination of the Thematic Learning Agenda that aims to explore how innovative approaches effectively incentivise and reward smallholder farmers for adopting sustainable climate-smart agricultural practices to promote soil health, biodiversity, water management, carbon sequestration, and to decrease GHG emissions. A dedicated thematic learning group exchanges knowledge and insights with staff across the network of the developments &amp; trends in policy &amp; technology in this domain as well as project experiences and lessons learned. We also support local projects &amp; initiatives to systematise and share their experiences.</narrative>
  </description>
